    deploys in staging").
  - [1mTimestamps:[0m the snapshot time and the Started column use the existing [38;5;153mformatTimestamp[39m, giving "Snapshot 2026-10-01
    09:30 UTC".
  - [1mLong deploys:[0m durations over an hour stay in minutes ("75m 0s"), as the spec literally says.

